			<div class="content" id="post-content-2126329">
									

<p>Finally got me to upvote this one.<br />
The previously narmy OTT logs always made me downvote- playing them serious with just a little understated humor this time around makes all the difference.</p>
<p>One little thing does still bother the car guy in me: the odometer being stuck at 999,999. Because of the way they're geared, odometers don't &quot;see&quot; any difference between rolling from 999999 to 000000 and rolling from 599999 to 600000- there's no reset mechanism to break. Mechanically, getting stuck at something arbitrary like 67290[randomly flailing number] is much more likely than getting stuck at 999999. Might be better to say &quot;my odometer rolled over from 999999&#160;4 times before it broke&quot; or something similar.</p>

							</div>

								
